#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1247-A expect=violation domain=EC
#note "H3 sister rule (minted 2026-08-19 per the absent-column doctrine): EC carries NONE of ECDOSE, ECDOSTXT, ECSTAT, ECOCCUR - no dose information is recorded anywhere. Sensitivity is Dataset, so the finding is reported ONCE for the dataset although both rows satisfy the check; the per-row twins stay silent on this configuration."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset EC class=INTERVENTIONS label="Exposure as Collected"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ECSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col ECTRT type=Char label="Name of Treatment"
col ECSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Treatment"
---
S1 | EC | 001 | 1 | DRUG A | 2020-02-01
S1 | EC | 001 | 2 | DRUG A | 2020-02-08
